{%- comment -%}
  The counting word for a bundle product: 包 for the refill packs, 瓶 for the
  bottles. Taken from the label of the product's first bundle tier
  (product.metafields.apgo.bundle_tiers), so naming that tier 單瓶 is all a
  bottled product needs: 單包 → 包, 單瓶 → 瓶. No tiers, or a first label that
  isn't 單 + one word, reads 包.

  Accepts:
    product — the product with the bundle

  Usage:
    {%- capture unit -%}{%- render 'apgo-bundle-unit', product: product -%}{%- endcapture -%}
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign unit = '包'
  for entry in product.metafields.apgo.bundle_tiers.value limit: 1
    capture first_label
      echo entry.label
    endcapture
    assign first_label = first_label | strip
    assign label_head = first_label | slice: 0
    if label_head == '單' and first_label.size == 2
      assign unit = first_label | slice: 1
    endif
  endfor
  echo unit
-%}
